{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02BEE0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Snake，村子北边那座桥是用来让压力钢管通过的，平时并不是给人走的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":95,"review_flag":"AUX_BRIDGE_FUNCTION_CORRECTED_PER_JPN"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"掉下去就会直坠谷底。小心。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"这种地方怎么会有水道？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"那不是灌溉水渠，而是水力发电用的钢管。可能连着伊拉苏火山的火口湖。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":"AUX_CRATER_LAKE_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"通常会在山谷底部修建水库，但这里太险峻了，我想应该做不到。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":"AUX_STEEP_TERRAIN_CONCLUSION_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"『Los Cantos』的意思是“剑之峰”。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":46,"review_flag":""}]}